{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach visible object, grab it, check properties, move around; retry if unsuccessful. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveAround    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    />",
